# Local browser-profile scratch used by scripts/benchmark.mjs and the CDP verify scripts.
# Both are throwaway: deleting them only costs a slower first launch next time.
.bench-chrome/
.bench-chrome-gpu/
# The verify scripts each take their own profile directory (`.cdp-profile-one9334`,
# `.cdp-profile-regress`, …), so a bare `.cdp-profile/` only ever caught one of them and
# left the rest to show up as untracked. The wildcard is what actually keeps them out.
.cdp-profile*/
.cdp-fresh/
